+         Thu Jan 06 2000, WOY 1
+         Fri Jan 07 2000, WOY 1
+         Sat Jan 08 2000, WOY 1
+         Sun Jan 09 2000, WOY 1
+         Mon Jan 10 2000, WOY 2
